# The budget ledger is live operational state, appended to on every guarded
# spend. Tracking it made every run a working-tree modification and put a
# mutable counter into the history as if it were a measurement. The ledger's
# durability requirement is Invariant 8 (enforced at the effect boundary), not
# Invariant 7 (provenance in git).
runs/budget/ledger.json
runs/budget/ledger.json.lock

# Fixed, crash-released Managed Bridge OS-lock identity. The file deliberately
# survives process exit; only the lock ownership is transient runtime state.
runs/bridge_watcher.lock

# Fixed, crash-released project-registry OS-lock identity. The JSON rows are
# authoritative; this persistent filename only anchors transient kernel state.
projects/.registry.lock

